  "body": "Records the 2026-11-20 edition decision after three-round source and scope review on Nov 23. Decisions: {\"defer\": 1, \"reject\": 54, \"accept\": 8}. Original publication/version dates, observed HF recommendation dates and first_seen remain distinct.\n\nThis PR changes only its dated review. Archived source hashes, quotations, exclusions and limits are recorded in the Nov 23 primary/independent reports. Older positive papers are explicitly historical additions; metadata-only rows do not revoke or repeat existing acceptances. No paid model requests, no experimental replication and no publication claim.\n\nValidation: source/date identity, direction and summary guards passed locally; exact-head build, tests and owner-decision checks are required before merge. The unresolved global recall warning remains 0.892857 versus 0.90.\n",
